WEBVTT

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.450
Wait! Ayanami!

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:28.830
Good morning, Enterprise.

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:33.660
Breakfast is ready.

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:43.540
Let's eat at the mess hall.

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:49.660
You still have those weird panties?

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:54.830
Isn't that too much?

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:56.450
Don't be modest.

00:02:56.950 --> 00:02:57.660
"Battleship <i>Nevada</i> "

00:02:57.660 --> 00:02:59.870
"Battleship <i>Nevada</i> "

00:02:57.660 --> 00:02:59.870
I owe you one for helping Oklahoma.

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:01.290
"Battleship <i>Nevada</i> "

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:01.290
Just showing my thanks.

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:09.660
Oh... Hello, Enterprise.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:11.410
Yes, hello.

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:12.950
Morning, what'll it be?

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:16.370
There's a panties sale
at the bazaar today.

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:16.370
Um...

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:19.500
Hey, Enterprise!

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:22.790
Wow, you eat a lot of breakfast.

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:25.500
No, this is... Um...

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:32.330
Belfast, why don't you
take a seat, too?

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:38.000
I have my duties as a maid.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:42.620
I don't think I can finish this by myself.

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:50.500
In that case, I will join you.

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:04.370
Hmm? What's up?

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:06.200
It's nothing.

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:06.200
Hmm?

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:09.500
I was just thinking...

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:12.540
...Enterprise might have changed a bit.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.080
Hello, Enterprise! How are you doing?

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:33.080
Hi, not bad. Thank you.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:36.410
Hey, Repulse! Don't run in the hallway!

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:41.040
Hey, Enterprise!

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:50.870
I never introduced my sisters, right?

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:52.750
Come on, say hi.

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:57.000
"Light Cruiser <i>Columbia</i> "

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:57.000
I'm Columbia, second ship in
the Cleveland class. Nice to meet you!

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:00.290
"Light Cruiser <i>Montpelier</i> "

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:00.290
I am Montpelier, the third ship.
Thank you for assisting my sister.

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:05.370
"Light Cruiser <i>Denver</i> "

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:05.370
I'm Denver, number four!
Honored to meet a hero!

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:07.910
Thanks, nice to meet you all.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:09.790
I'm proud of my little sisters!

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:12.700
No, I'm nothing
compared to you...

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:15.750
You're number one, Cleveland!

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:20.620
C-Come on, I told you,
stop saying stuff like that!

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:22.660
You sisters seem to get along well.

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:31.910
Hey... What happened to that thing
we recovered from Sakura Empire?

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:34.950
Yes, about that...

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:43.000
A black Mental Cube...

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:46.700
Sakura Empire's secret weapon,
based on Siren technology...

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:53.080
Can't we use this to nullify
their mass-produced Siren ships?

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:56.290
It's the <i>Orochi</i> that controls the ships.

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:58.200
This one is just for support.

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:00.580
A massive warship named <i>Orochi</i> ...

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:03.750
So that's what
Sakura Empire is building?

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:07.080
I wonder what the relationship is
between the <i>Orochi</i> and this cube?

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:13.830
What we do know is that
a Siren gave them this cube,

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:17.000
and that Akagi works with that Siren.

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:24.580
If that's the case, it means that
the whole of Sakura Empire is being deceived.

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:29.620
Akagi... What are you thinking?

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:08.120
Enterprise?

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:14.870
Is something wrong?
You seemed to be distracted.

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:16.410
No...

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:20.040
I'm fine. It's nothing.

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:31.790
See, that looks good, doesn't it?

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:37.660
This would suit you better
than me, dear sister...

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:42.000
That's not true. See? Look.

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:45.950
I knew it. This color
looks good on you, Kaga.

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:50.370
I'll take this.

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:51.580
Oh...

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:59.160
"Destroyer <i>Fumizuki</i> "      "Destroyer <i>Mutsuki</i> "
      "Destroyer <i>Minazuki</i> " "Destroyer <i>Mikazuki</i> "

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:59.160
I want <i>taiyaki</i> !

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:02.000
They make them with extra bean paste.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.910
Hurry! They might sell out!

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:06.620
Wait for me!

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:06.620
--Don't run--we might trip!

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:08.700
"Destroyer <i>Uzuki</i> "

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:08.700
Wait!

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:12.080
Don't leave me behind!

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:24.700
Hey, careful. Running is dangerous.

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:28.370
Oh, no... What should I do...?

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:30.750
Um... We're sorry.

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:32.700
We didn't do it on purpose.

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.200
Hmm? What happened?

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:36.330
P-Please don't eat us...

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:38.910
Wait, I'm not angry...

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.910
Don't make me use P- <i>kun</i> !

00:08:45.910 --> 00:08:48.500
Oh, what have you done, Kaga?

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.750
You can't make these little girls cry.

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:52.790
Dear sister...

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:57.750
Um! Um... I'm sorry!

00:08:57.750 --> 00:09:01.370
You can have all of my candy.
Please don't be angry!

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:03.700
Like I said, I...

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:07.750
I see. We'll take you up on that.

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:17.580
Kaga, you can forgive them now, right?

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:19.370
Y-Yes...

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:26.660
Here's a reward for good little girls
who know how to apologize properly.

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:28.370
Don't forget to share.

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:36.750
Wow!

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:42.370
Thank you, ma'am!

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:47.160
<i>Taiyaki</i> ! Hurry!
Let's eat the <i>kompeito</i> , too!

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:50.620
I just told them not to run...

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:57.330
Kaga. Don't you wish they could
stay together, forever?

00:09:57.330 --> 00:09:58.790
Dear sister...?

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:18.040
Lots of great deals!

00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:20.830
Don't miss these great deals!

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:25.910
Fledglings! Read this and
do some studying for a change!

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:38.450
There are more shops now...

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:41.830
It's very lively here.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:49.040
You're going to eat all of that?!

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:51.290
It's for my sister!

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:55.580
The selection is quite impressive...

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:57.660
We could use these in our classes.

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:04.000
It's like a human town.

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:06.620
We are human.

00:11:06.620 --> 00:11:08.950
This conversation again.

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:12.450
I don't understand.

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:16.000
Welcome! Fresh flowers here!

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:16.000
I don't understand.

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:22.450
Enterprise, what you need
is an elegance in your heart.

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:26.370
What is that? I don't get it at all.

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:29.290
Do you want me to be a maid, too?

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:31.540
Oh, would you join us?

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:36.540
I can certainly discipline you to become
a maid suited for any household.

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:39.580
No, that's a...

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:44.410
Maid or not...

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:48.750
...starting something new
is most likely beneficial.

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:53.290
A hobby, some kind of job,
anything other than fighting.

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:57.450
That won't be easy for me.

00:11:57.450 --> 00:11:59.620
It would be a worthy challenge.

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:03.290
Human life is all about adventure.

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:06.290
I suppose that might be true.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:10.250
Please ponder it as much as you need.

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:15.500
That is precisely the reason why
we earned these human forms.

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:33.160
Phew.

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:34.540
Shiny clean.

00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:39.000
We're enemies...

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:51.200
But...

00:12:57.200 --> 00:13:00.200
But I don't want to regret!

00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:07.580
Javelin, no slacking off.

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:11.620
You!

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:14.120
I'll get you back!

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:17.700
I'm all in.

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:27.750
Wow, where did you get those?

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:31.080
I want one like that, too!

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:40.120
Sister, why did you pick those panties?

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:41.750
Show me later!

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:43.370
I knew I could count on you, Oklahoma.

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:49.040
Oh, Unicorn?

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:56.000
Why are you wet?

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:58.410
This is... Um...

00:13:58.410 --> 00:14:01.790
Are you taking a bath, too?
Let's go together!

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:03.790
Oh, I, um...

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:06.790
Cold.

00:14:06.790 --> 00:14:10.620
We're going to catch a cold. Let's go!

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:12.700
Oh, um...

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:16.870
Wow, such cute underwear!

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:20.290
Oh, my. Impressive...

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:25.790
Sis! Do all Royal Navy girls wear
grown-up underwear like that?

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:34.160
Hey, so how is it, really?

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:37.500
Do you like, pay attention
to your panties and stuff?

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:40.160
No, I don't wear any.

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:44.580
I'm sorry, I couldn't hear you.

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:46.200
Like I said, I don't wear them.

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:57.750
Oh, dear...

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:01.500
Bath, quickly.

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:04.250
There's no need to rush...

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:05.370
The water is cooling.

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:06.790
No, it's not!

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:08.620
We'll see you inside, Unicorn!

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:32.250
Oh, that feels good...

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:34.410
Yahoo! Bath time!

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:36.790
Hey, don't run! That's dangerous!

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:39.500
Here we go!

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:39.500
Oh, watch out, that's...

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:42.620
What?! It's electric!

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:49.410
H-How can a b-bath be e-electric...?

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:52.000
"Destroyer <i>Eldridge</i> "

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:55.580
Eldridge leaks electricity...

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:02.080
Sis! Royal Navy girls are awesome!

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:10.250
She really wasn't wearing any...

00:16:12.410 --> 00:16:16.750
Hot springs after work? This is the best.

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:23.620
A thermae-style great bath,
hand built by we the Royal Navy!

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:27.200
Hot springs aren't exclusive
to Sakura Empire!

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:29.290
It's quite impressive, Your Majesty.

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:45.540
Wow, Unicorn, your breasts are so big...

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:54.870
Wait, what? Wh-What's wrong, Unicorn?

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:04.910
I'm so short, but my breasts are like this...

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:07.080
There's something wrong with me...

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:09.250
I wouldn't say that...

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:16.370
Unicorn, you have a great body--
you're awesome.

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:19.620
You don't mean that.

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:21.580
I do.

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:26.160
But I'm not like the others...

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:28.790
Everyone is different. It's normal.

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:30.040
Yes.

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:32.120
There's nothing wrong with anyone.

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:36.700
Really?

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:03.870
Maybe... you're right.

00:18:14.950 --> 00:18:17.540
Something good happen?

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:19.830
Yes, very much so.

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:54.040
Ayanami? That girl we met?

00:18:55.330 --> 00:19:00.580
We're supposed to be enemies,
so this could be very wrong, but...

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:09.080
I don't want to give up on her.
I want to be friends with Ayanami.

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:18.200
I don't know anything about her.
I don't want to fight her like this.

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:21.370
We haven't started anything yet.

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:46.910
One day, you'll remember what wishes
the people placed in your name.

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:06.620
Enterprise, having trouble sleeping?

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:08.950
I felt that the ocean called out to me.

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:12.830
I'm joking.

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:15.410
That is quite unusual.

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:20.250
Yes. Perhaps I'm getting a little emotional.

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:22.330
You should keep warm.

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:27.080
Coffee, at this hour?

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:36.660
You're a naughty grown-up.

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:49.540
It's very quiet.

00:20:49.540 --> 00:20:50.750
Yes.

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:54.870
I don't mind a quiet ocean.

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:08.120
Oh, how pretty. Must be Akagi's taste.

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:09.660
You're not welcome in here.

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:13.330
Come on, let me join you for a drink.

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:16.700
No. You'll ruin the taste.

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:20.410
Always so hard to get, aren't you?

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:25.330
They took the black Mental Cube.
Aren't you at all worried?

00:21:25.330 --> 00:21:27.950
What are you scheming?

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:30.370
Not your concern.

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:35.160
Are you sure you and Akagi
are after the same thing?

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:38.540
Enough!

00:21:43.040 --> 00:21:45.450
One-sided love can be painful,
don't you think?

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:49.870
<i>Guten nacht.</i> Have a pleasant night.

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:01.910
Soon... We'll meet again soon.

00:22:04.750 --> 00:22:06.450
Dear sister Amagi...

00:22:28.870 --> 00:22:34.290
<i>The ripples seeing each other</i>

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:40.040
<i>Are messages exchanged with you</i>

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:46.080
<i>Connecting us across this blue ocean</i>

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:51.700
<i>Guideposts of light</i>

00:22:51.700 --> 00:22:57.370
<i>Have you met someone nice?</i>

00:22:57.370 --> 00:23:03.040
<i>Are your days filled with smiles?</i>

00:23:03.040 --> 00:23:08.540
<i>Filling your melancholy eyes with light</i>

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:13.620
<i>When the starshine wanes in them</i>

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:19.500
<i>I'm close to you</i>

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:25.620
<i>Always by your side</i>

00:23:25.620 --> 00:23:30.870
<i>you can't see the next day</i>

00:23:30.870 --> 00:23:37.160
<i>I am calling out to your heart</i>

00:23:37.160 --> 00:23:42.080
<i>Please stay with me</i>

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:48.120
<i>Please don't give up</i>

00:23:48.120 --> 00:23:57.200
<i>Until the morning comes</i>
<i>when we can hold hands</i>
